  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></math>, then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi></math> for which the line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> always passes through a fixed point is"
  },
